      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "To specify a different duration, use [`easeOut(duration:)`](animation/easeout(duration:).md).",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nstruct ContentView: View {\n    @State private var scale = 0.5\n\n    var body: some View {\n        VStack {\n            Circle()\n                .scale(scale)\n                .animation(.easeOut, value: scale)\n            HStack {\n                Button(\"+\") { scale += 0.1 }\n                Button(\"-\") { scale -= 0.1 }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```",
